flowchart TD
    U[Buyer / Seller / Staff Browser] --> DNS[Route 53 + ACM]
    DNS --> ALB[ECS Express Mode / Application Load Balancer]
    ALB --> WEB[Django Web Tasks]
    WEB --> DB[(RDS PostgreSQL 18)]
    WEB --> S3[(S3 private staging/processed media)]
    WEB --> STRIPE[Stripe Checkout + Webhooks]
    WEB --> SECRETS[Secrets Manager]
    WEB --> LOGS[CloudWatch]
    WORKER[Django Outbox Worker] --> DB
    WORKER --> SES[Amazon SES]
    WORKER --> S3
    WORKER --> STRIPE
    WORKER --> LOGS
    EVENT[EventBridge Scheduler] --> JOBS[ECS one-off management commands]
    JOBS --> DB
    S3 --> CF[CloudFront media delivery]
